{
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.10.0",
  "exporter": { "name": "Camunda Modeler", "version": "5.40.0" },
  "schemaVersion": 18,
  "id": "gp-approval-form",
  "type": "default",
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "Text_Header",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GP approval gate — high-risk LP\nThe ML model flagged **{{highRiskLp.lpId}}** on capital call **{{callId}}** (fund {{fundId}}) with a default-risk score of **{{highRiskLp.riskScore}}** (threshold 0.70).\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Commitment | ${{highRiskLp.commitmentUSD}} |\n| Draw amount | ${{highRiskLp.drawAmountUSD}} |\n| Amount committed this call | ${{highRiskLp.amountUSD}} |\n| Contact | {{highRiskLp.email}} |\n\n**Waive** accepts the commitment as-is. **Enforce** keeps the commitment but issues a formal compliance/enforcement notice to the LP."
    },
    {
      "id": "Radio_Action",
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "gpAction",
      "label": "Decision",
      "values": [
        { "label": "Waive — accept LP commitment", "value": "waive" },
        { "label": "Enforce — issue compliance enforcement notice", "value": "enforce" }
      ],
      "validate": { "required": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_GPName",
      "type": "textfield",
      "key": "gpName",
      "label": "Approving GP",
      "defaultValue": "Jane Doe (Managing Partner)",
      "validate": { "required": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "Field_Comment",
      "type": "textarea",
      "key": "gpComment",
      "label": "Rationale (audit trail)"
    }
  ]
}
